OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain, some
OL,6,Fheavy, across northern England, north
OL,7,FWales and Cornwall will become more
OL,8,Fwidespread across England and Wales
OL,9,Fovernight. Some early clear spells in
OL,10,Fthe southeast. Generally clearer
OL,11,Facross Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,12,Fwith some showers and a patchy frost.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FOutbreaks of sometimes
OL,15,Fheavy rain across England and Wales
OL,16,Fwill gradually becoming confined to
OL,17,Fsoutheast England on Wednesday.
OL,18,FElsewhere sunny spells, though a
OL,19,Fchilly wind and some blustery showers
OL,20,Fdeveloping.
